    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>procedurally</strong> <strong>generated</strong>\u00a0map and survive the <strong>horrors</strong> of what may lie ahead. Escape audio and visual based entities to find your way out alive. You are a police officer exploring abandon locations looking for evidence, find it and <strong>escape</strong> alive...<br><br>The Yellow Files is created in Unreal Engine 5 which allows for <strong>semi-realistic</strong> visuals to explore and haunt your world! Play with your friends or by yourself and make it to the end, find out the story by studying the mysteries of the environments around you. What happened to this place? What could have caused such devastation?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>procedurally</strong> <strong>generated</strong>\u00a0map and survive the <strong>horrors</strong> of what may lie ahead. Escape audio and visual based entities to find your way out alive. You are a police officer exploring abandon locations looking for evidence, find it and <strong>escape</strong> alive...<br><br>The Yellow Files is created in Unreal Engine 5 which allows for <strong>semi-realistic</strong> visuals to explore and haunt your world! Play with your friends or by yourself and make it to the end, find out the story by studying the mysteries of the environments around you. What happened to this place? What could have caused such devastation?</p>",
